        <mxCell id="note" value="Lock order: repository publication&lt;br&gt;lock, then ideation.lifecycle.lock&lt;br&gt;(ideation writes only), then the&lt;br&gt;shard lock. Writes change no SQLite&lt;br&gt;data. The SQLite cache catches up&lt;br&gt;on the next read (diagram 03)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
